KNOWNBUG (unsound): [expr.prim.lambda.closure]/1 -- each closure is a distinct
object with its own capture members.  CBMC stores a lambda's capture in a single
shared file-local symbol, so two closures of the same lambda type share capture
storage and the second construction overwrites the first.  See
doc/architectural/cpp-lambda-closure-support.md.
